{'symbol': 'KEY', 'date': '2022-06-15 15:21:00', 'title': 'KEYCORP RAISES ITS PRIME LENDING RATE TO 4.75 PERCENT', 'text': "CLEVELAND , JUNE 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KEYCORP (NYSE: KEY) AND ITS BANKING AFFILIATES HAVE RAISED THEIR PRIME LENDING RATE TO 4.75 PERCENT FROM 4.00 PERCENT, EFFECTIVE TOMORROW, JUNE 16, 2022. ABOUT KEYCORP KEYCORP'S ROOTS TRACE BACK NEARLY 200 YEARS TO ALBANY, NEW YORK."}